{"title": "satisfy all：双重验证缺一不可", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si localhost:8002/ | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 401 Unauthorized"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si -u user:WRONG localhost:8002/ | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 401 Unauthorized"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si -u user:password1 localhost:8002/ | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "同一来源：IP 过了，密码错了照样 401"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
